Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)现身吧 CNo.107！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.85,0:00:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)这样一来 所有的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超百 CNo.都到场上来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.13,0:00:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)夏克。不 纳修 你……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧 这就是我的……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 七皇真正的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从额外卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动冀望皇巴利安的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从额外卡组发动怪兽效果？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.21,0:00:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上存在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只以上混沌超百 No.时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将它们全部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}视为等级7的超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.69,0:00:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将这张卡超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将成为等级7的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士 拉格纳·无限{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高贵恶魔 新时空{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以及 巨手·红
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.55,0:00:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用东星安布拉尔超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以7只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.23,0:01:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身为混沌化身的军神啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将殷切的愿望带到我身边。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}集结吧，七皇之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量 冀望皇巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是真正的……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}七皇之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.35,0:01:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冀望皇巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我最终 谁都没能守护住。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}杜尔贝 米扎艾尔 基拉古。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉格 阿里特 以及贝库塔》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.97,0:01:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将七皇之力合而为一引导巴利安的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.87,0:01:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个梦想终究没能实现。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.41,0:01:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)那 那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量·单位中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.75,0:01:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}七皇的身影……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.50,0:01:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个怪兽混沌超量是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶人七皇本身吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.77,0:02:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《纳修：所以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗是我们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}实现那个梦想的决斗！》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……我感受到了 鲨鱼的斗志。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.43,0:02:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是他的混沌。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.98,0:02:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《用我们的力量必定开辟异晶人的未来！》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冀望皇异晶人的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.87,0:03:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.33,0:04:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成混沌超量·单位的数量乘以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力7000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 是陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 超量·祝福！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.49,0:04:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在 手牌为零时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手场上存在怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.89,0:04:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被特殊召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照那些超量单元的数量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽７张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 冀望皇巴利安的更进一步的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.54,0:04:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用混沌超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或者 支付400生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以发动作为混沌超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的 CNo.的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.23,0:04:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 七皇所有的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量 No.的效果都…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们这一回合
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须全部承受下来吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是１回合内不能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择两次相同的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下不妙啊 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.07,0:04:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 这就是我们七皇的羁绊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.21,0:05:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我支付400生命值…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.107。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.65,0:05:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次 将这张卡以外的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并恢复到回合开始时的状态。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时间暴君！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.55,0:05:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 希望的效果就被无效了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 这个回合 除了我允许的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡以外 都不能发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}furthermore 我再
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.51,0:05:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 支付400生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.102
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高贵恶魔的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)将对手1只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们死死抓住的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在就下定决心 如花般凋零吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.82,0:06:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 我进一步支付400生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌幻影103
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拉格纳·无限的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)对方怪兽的攻击力发生变化时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个差值作为伤害给予对方！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.65,0:06:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)希望的攻击力变化是2500。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.07,0:06:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 是2500的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.35,0:06:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于新·塔奇翁的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.89,0:06:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的卡不能发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.30,0:06:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪有这么容易！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动永续陷阱 阿里巴利亚！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽造成的效果伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效并{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时 自己场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部变成守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以无效对手怪兽的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌发动的陷阱……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新空间人的唯一弱点被抓住攻击了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.57,0:06:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我，唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，支付400生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
