Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨手·红的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）场上以表侧表示存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡以外的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
