Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（纳修）这样一来，永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里巴利亚的效果也无效了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.06,0:07:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}何等猛烈的攻势！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.11,0:07:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
