Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.105
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彗星之卡俄斯的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.54,0:07:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)1回合1次破坏对手怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 霍普竟然！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.51,0:07:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就是你们的末日了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 冀望皇巴利安 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:08:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能在这种地方就这样结束啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎守护者的效果！
