Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.69,0:08:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付400生命值 呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.104
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安布拉的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)将对手的怪兽效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手的手牌１张送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)嘎嘎嘎嘎——地狱人偶的特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.87,0:08:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.47,0:08:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 将你的手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随机１张 送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你们的生命值就减半了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.83,0:08:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是真正的最后一击了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 冀望皇异晶人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 游马要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在7000的伤害下消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经不行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永别了游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 墓地里的发动虹之衣的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到直接攻击时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.43,0:09:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将这家伙从墓地特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 那我就破坏虹之衣。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（虹之衣）克利！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然将七皇的 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.81,0:09:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完全运用自如了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 鲨鱼的认真实力强得离谱…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.01,0:09:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟能完全防住我们七皇的攻击果然厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.89,0:09:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.09,0:09:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}混沌・暴{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}风{\fnYusei Magic}・抽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}卡{\fnYusei Magic}。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有混沌超量怪兽和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法 陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}存在1张以上时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的魔法 陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我根据破坏的卡的数量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，抽3张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将3张卡背面朝上，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼……好险啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.47,0:10:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他能扛住那一击简直可以说是奇迹。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.71,0:10:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.40,0:10:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么他不用混沌超量·单位，而是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}削减自己的生命值？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.65,0:10:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不想降低冀望皇巴利安的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战略我明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但现在，和我们之间的生命值差距已经很小了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我总觉得能理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张混沌超量·单位里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.65,0:10:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定还有七皇的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我感觉到了一边承受着那家伙的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙一定 在这场决斗中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和大家一起战斗着。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和大家一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.11,0:11:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只怪兽就是 巴利安七皇本身。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙在拼命守护着和大家之间的羁绊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些强力使用混沌之力的家伙们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知何时 已经被那股力量吞噬进去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那家伙的混沌完全不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾娜说过。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要守护某人想要为了某人而活下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.73,0:11:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一定就是生命之力本身。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因如此 他才能将 至今为止的混沌之力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}控制住吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.49,0:11:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不如说 如今他的姿态才是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌所拥有的最大可能性。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿 这不是超帅的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.53,0:11:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我果然还是不明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.15,0:11:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我为了星光界的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}存续而一直战斗至今。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.19,0:11:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 难道就因为这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就可以毁灭异晶界吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能二选一什么的不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.47,0:12:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了不让这种事发生 我才……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们才一直战斗至今。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.15,0:12:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道不是吗？ 星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.75,0:12:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.34,0:12:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）超热血沸腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用我自己和你 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）当羁绊相连之时力量与心合而为一{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光之奇迹与传说就此诞生！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越转换
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了吗，泽阿尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？到底会发生什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道我们的世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在急速靠近？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的决斗之力因增强而{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与巴利安世界融合的地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.07,0:13:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和星光世界之间的相互吸引力变强了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去三个世界要是重叠在一起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的世界也好，星光世界也好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.02,0:13:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗结束前都撑不住啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.61,0:13:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊…。逃不掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:13:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底会怎么样啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好可怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那到底是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)说到底
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.77,0:14:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底会变成什么样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.14,0:14:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小猫)游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(哈尔特)大家冷静点！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(哈尔特)希望…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能放弃未来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在我们说话的这段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了守护我们的未来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.95,0:14:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有拼死战斗着的同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥用生命托付了未来的同伴们！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)所以不要放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！游马一定正在战斗着！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是，一定！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.82,0:14:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)一马… 一马，能听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.41,0:14:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(一马)那个声音是 拜隆吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)好久不见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.91,0:14:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我得向你道谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你们一家让游马成长了起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.86,0:14:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是我该说的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了游马，我才能找回家人。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没时间了我只说重点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在我的儿子们寄托了希望的游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.43,0:15:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正面临危机。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)三个世界 现在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在逐渐同化。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，如果是我们的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.79,0:15:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想把最后的力量用在游马身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.82,0:15:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，听得见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里由我们来挡住！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.23,0:15:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我们见证到底吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.97,0:15:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}见证你们的命运！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，继续决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续这场赌上你们未来的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两股互相吸引的力量停下来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，就是现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆，老爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.36,0:16:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）所有的光芒啊！力量啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.55,0:16:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄宿于我的右臂照亮希望之路吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量·掉落·复生！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.28,0:16:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4以下的怪兽送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 根据霍普的阶级数量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你怪兽的超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:16:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去除！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的阶级是4！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.07,0:17:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此去除4个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想！ 陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量·威胁！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己怪兽超量的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为效果对象时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个效果无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我可以抽1张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 自己每有1个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.69,0:17:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.55,0:17:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就回复500点生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.41,0:17:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 霍普因为没能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.60,0:17:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将超量单位去除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变成零了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.22,0:17:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然连超量单位的对策都准备好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是！ 好戏才刚开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.71,0:17:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾莉法斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你那里得到的 这张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份心意如今将在这场决斗中开花结果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 是选择自己场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级最高的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比所选怪兽的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:17:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比它高1阶或2阶的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.01,0:18:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)这就是我们的全力！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.32,0:18:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}极限突破吧 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当人超越希望 怀抱梦想之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在遥远的彼方新的未来将会显现！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越极限 用这双手抓住吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 彼岸·霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼岸·霍普 攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会受到对手的卡牌效果影响！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.12,0:19:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼岸·霍普有什么效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这边的攻击力都高出好几截！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼岸·霍普的进一步效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我回合的战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.41,0:19:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手怪兽的攻击力变成零！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.33,0:19:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是现在 彼岸超霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.31,0:19:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 彼岸斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 额外脱出！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.72,0:19:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的怪兽额外受到攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.66,0:19:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我作为这个效果的代价{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要支付彼岸超霍普攻击力数值
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3000点生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼… 竟然做到这种地步。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖伏3张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.06,0:20:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光 我不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.67,0:20:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冀望皇 巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击彼岸超霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.39,0:20:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动！ 叠光·维卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.54,0:20:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽之间进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠光单位数量较少的一方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个数值是 每有1个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方的叠光单位就提升600！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼岸·希望号的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超过了冀望皇巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.58,0:21:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！ 我支付400生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.13,0:21:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动拉格纳·无限的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.90,0:21:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的攻击力发生变化时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个差值作为伤害给予对方！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.23,0:21:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃下4200的伤害 消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.01,0:21:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动！ 伤害反应者！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在效果伤害发生时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.69,0:21:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个伤害无效并{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.87,0:21:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.78,0:21:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升800！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力8000！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！彼岸·希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.39,0:21:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我向天地神明起誓！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了抓住未来而战斗到底！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.67,0:21:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀吧，希望之光！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑 彼岸斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.67,0:21:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论到哪都要把我的……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:22:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要把我们的梦想击碎吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.09,0:23:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.78,0:23:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.14,0:23:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.16,0:23:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.73,0:23:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.36,0:24:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.91,0:24:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.01,0:24:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.39,0:24:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.48,0:24:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.59,0:24:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.61,0:24:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.26,0:24:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
